    "preparedScale": "Definition scale0 vector at+0x420, either constant or evaluated at clamped particle phase, multiplies matching birth-record XY/Z components and a shared emitter factor. Stores preserve XY/Z order at draw+20/+24/+28. An optional external uniform factor can multiply all three components afterward.",
